<p>The <strong class="selflink">M2DA_base 2da</strong> defines the other <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="2da">2da</a> files which are <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2da" title="M2da (page does not exist)">m2da</a> files and can be <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA#Extending_the_game_via_M2DAs" title="2DA">extended</a> using an m2da fragment.
</p>
