<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>This 2da is itself an m2da. Even though it does not define itself as such and does not assign itself an <b>ID</b>,  it can be extended by m2da fragments which have names starting with "M2DA_"
</p>
